---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>새마을 상회 — 동네 종합 생필품·철물 상회</title>
  <meta name="description" content="새마을 상회 — 면목동 정직한 동네마트·철물점. 잘 살아보세! 생필품·철물·공구 한자리에. 동네 무료배달." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Black+Han+Sans&family=Do+Hyeon&family=Gothic+A1:wght@400;500;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --green: #2e7d32;
      --green-dark: #1b5e20;
      --green-deep: #14401a;
      --yellow: #ffd400;
      --yellow-deep: #f5b800;
      --red: #d32f2f;
      --red-dark: #a31515;
      --paper: #f4ead2;
      --paper-dark: #e7d8b3;
      --ink: #20180c;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Gothic A1', 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* 거친 인쇄 질감 */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9000;
      opacity: 0.06;
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px);
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }
    body::after {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9001;
      opacity: 0.5;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.04) 0, transparent 1.5px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 0, transparent 1.2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 45% 80%, rgba(0,0,0,0.04) 0, transparent 1.4px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 0, transparent 1.3px);
      background-size: 7px 7px, 11px 11px, 9px 9px, 13px 13px;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, .slogan, .banner-text {
      font-family: 'Black Han Sans', 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

    /* ===== 현수막 띠 ===== */
    .ribbon {
      background: var(--red);
      color: var(--yellow);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(13px, 2.6vw, 18px);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--yellow);
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--yellow);
      position: relative;
      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--red-dark);
    }
    .ribbon span { display: inline-block; padding: 0 8px; }
    .ribbon .dot { color: var(--white); }

    /* ===== 히어로 ===== */
    .hero {
      background: var(--green);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 0 0 50px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-bottom: 10px solid var(--yellow);
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.07) 0, rgba(0,0,0,0.07) 2px, transparent 2px, transparent 22px);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    /* 빛살 방사 */
    .hero .rays {
      position: absolute;
      top: -40%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 160%;
      height: 200%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg at 50% 50%,
        rgba(255,212,0,0.10) 0deg, rgba(255,212,0,0.10) 7deg,
        transparent 7deg, transparent 22deg);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .topflags {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 56px 0 8px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .flag {
      width: 46px;
      height: 34px;
      position: relative;
      filter: drop-shadow(2px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.25));
      animation: wave 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .flag:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .3s; }
    .flag:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .6s; }
    .flag:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: .9s; }
    .flag:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
    @keyframes wave {
      0%,100% { transform: skewY(-3deg) scaleX(1); }
      50% { transform: skewY(3deg) scaleX(0.96); }
    }

    .hero-mark {
      display: block;
      margin: 8px auto 4px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      filter: drop-shadow(3px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
    }

    .hero h1 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: clamp(46px, 13vw, 132px);
      line-height: 0.9;
      color: var(--yellow);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      margin-top: 6px;
      text-shadow:
        4px 4px 0 var(--red),
        7px 7px 0 var(--green-deep);
    }
    .hero .sub {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(15px, 3.4vw, 24px);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-top: 14px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .marquee-banner {
      margin: 30px auto 0;
      max-width: 760px;
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: var(--red-dark);
      border: 4px solid var(--white);
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      transform: rotate(-1.2deg);
      padding: 12px 18px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .marquee-banner .banner-text {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 7vw, 56px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .marquee-banner small {
      display: block;
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(11px, 2.4vw, 15px);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: var(--green-dark);
    }

    .hero-people {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-top: 34px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .hero-people svg { filter: drop-shadow(2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.25)); }

    /* ===== 섹션 공통 ===== */
    section { padding: 60px 0; position: relative; }

    .sec-head {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--red);
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-family: 'Black Han Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(24px, 5.5vw, 42px);
      padding: 6px 22px 8px;
      transform: rotate(-1.4deg);
      box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--green-dark);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--red-dark);
    }
    .sec-tag {
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-size: clamp(13px, 2.6vw, 17px);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding-left: 4px;
    }

    /* 취급 품목 */
    .items {
      background:
        linear-gradient(0deg, var(--paper-dark), var(--paper));
    }
    .item-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .item-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 3px solid var(--green-dark);
      box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--green);
      padding: 22px 20px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .item-card:nth-child(even) { box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--red); border-color: var(--red-dark); }
    .item-card .ic {
      width: 54px; height: 54px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      background: var(--yellow);
      border: 3px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .item-card h3 {
      font-size: clamp(21px, 4vw, 27px);
      color: var(--green-dark);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .item-card:nth-child(even) h3 { color: var(--red-dark); }
    .item-card p {
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4a3d28;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    /* 이번주 특가 */
    .deals { background: var(--green-dark); color: var(--white); border-top: 8px solid var(--yellow); border-bottom: 8px solid var(--yellow); }
    .deals .sec-head { box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--yellow-deep); }
    .deal-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .deal {
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 4px solid var(--white);
      padding: 20px 18px 22px;
      position: relative;
      transform: rotate(-0.8deg);
    }
    .deal:nth-child(even) { transform: rotate(1deg); }
    .deal .tag {
      position: absolute;
      top: -16px; right: -10px;
      background: var(--red);
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-family: 'Black Han Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 5px 11px;
      transform: rotate(8deg);
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--red-dark);
      border: 2px solid var(--yellow);
    }
    .deal .name {
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .deal .was {
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #8a7a5c;
      text-decoration: line-through;
    }
    .deal .now {
      font-family: 'Black Han Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 7vw, 42px);
      color: var(--red);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .deal .now small { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink); }
    .deal .unit {
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6a5a3c;
      margin-top: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .deals-note {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-top: 26px;
      color: var(--yellow);
    }

    /* 배달 안내 */
    .delivery { background: var(--paper); }
    .delivery-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0;
      border: 4px solid var(--ink);
      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--green);
      background: var(--white);
    }
    .delivery-left {
      background: var(--green);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 34px 30px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .delivery-left::after {
      content:"";
      position:absolute; inset:0;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px);
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    .delivery-left h3 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 44px);
      color: var(--yellow);
      line-height: 0.95;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--green-deep);
    }
    .delivery-left p {
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .delivery-right { padding: 30px; }
    .dl-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 13px 4px;
      border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--paper-dark);
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
    }
    .dl-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .dl-row .k { color: var(--ink); font-size: 15px; }
    .dl-row .v { color: var(--green-dark); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; }
    .dl-row .v.free { color: var(--red); }

    /* 연락 */
    .contact { background: var(--red); color: var(--white); border-top: 8px solid var(--yellow); position: relative; }
    .contact::before {
      content:"";
      position:absolute; inset:0;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 0 3px, transparent 3px 24px);
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    .contact .inner { text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .contact h2 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 9vw, 76px);
      color: var(--yellow);
      line-height: 0.95;
      text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--red-dark);
    }
    .contact .phone {
      font-family: 'Black Han Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 9vw, 70px);
      color: var(--white);
      margin: 16px 0 4px;
      text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--red-dark);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .contact .addr {
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(14px, 3vw, 19px);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .contact .hours {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 22px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border: 3px solid var(--yellow);
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--green-deep);
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      transform: rotate(-1deg);
    }

    footer {
      background: var(--green-deep);
      color: var(--paper-dark);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 26px 16px;
      font-family: 'Do Hyeon', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    footer .seed { vertical-align: middle; margin-bottom: 6px; }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .delivery-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .delivery-left { box-shadow: none; }
      section { padding: 46px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 데모바 -->
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 40 · 새마을 상회 — 70년대 새마을운동 포스터 스타일</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <!-- 구호 현수막 띠 -->
  <div class="ribbon">
    <span>근면</span><span class="dot">·</span><span>자조</span><span class="dot">·</span><span>협동</span><span class="dot">·</span><span>잘 살아보세</span><span class="dot">·</span><span>면목동 새마을 상회</span>
  </div>

  <!-- 히어로 -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="rays"></div>

    <div class="topflags">
      <!-- 작은 깃발들 -->
      <svg class="flag" viewBox="0 0 46 34"><polygon points="0,0 46,0 38,17 46,34 0,34" fill="#ffd400" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
      <svg class="flag" viewBox="0 0 46 34"><polygon points="0,0 46,0 38,17 46,34 0,34" fill="#d32f2f" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
      <svg class="flag" viewBox="0 0 46 34"><polygon points="0,0 46,0 38,17 46,34 0,34" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
      <svg class="flag" viewBox="0 0 46 34"><polygon points="0,0 46,0 38,17 46,34 0,34" fill="#d32f2f" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
      <svg class="flag" viewBox="0 0 46 34"><polygon points="0,0 46,0 38,17 46,34 0,34" fill="#ffd400" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
    </div>

    <!-- 새마을 마크: 노랑 새싹 원형 -->
    <svg class="hero-mark" width="118" height="118" viewBox="0 0 118 118" aria-label="새마을 상회 마크">
      <circle cx="59" cy="59" r="55" fill="#ffd400" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="5"/>
      <circle cx="59" cy="59" r="55" fill="none" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/>
      <!-- 새싹 줄기 -->
      <path d="M59 92 Q59 64 59 48" stroke="#1b5e20" stroke-width="7" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <!-- 왼쪽 잎 -->
      <path d="M59 62 Q34 60 28 38 Q52 38 59 60 Z" fill="#2e7d32" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/>
      <!-- 오른쪽 잎 -->
      <path d="M59 56 Q84 52 92 30 Q66 32 59 54 Z" fill="#1b5e20" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/>
    </svg>

    <h1>새마을 상회</h1>
    <p class="sub">동네 생필품 · 철물 · 공구 종합 상회 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 1973년 그 마음 그대로</p>

    <div class="marquee-banner">
      <div class="banner-text">잘 살아보세!</div>
      <small>정직한 물건, 바른 저울, 한 동네 한 식구</small>
    </div>

    <!-- 일하는 사람 실루엣 -->
    <div class="hero-people">
      <!-- 짐 든 사람 -->
      <svg width="58" height="92" viewBox="0 0 58 92"><g fill="#14401a">
        <circle cx="26" cy="13" r="9"/>
        <path d="M18 24 h16 l5 30 h-26 z"/>
        <rect x="14" y="52" width="9" height="36"/>
        <rect x="29" y="52" width="9" height="36"/>
        <rect x="2" y="28" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
      </g></svg>
      <!-- 깃발 든 사람 -->
      <svg width="58" height="100" viewBox="0 0 58 100"><g fill="#14401a">
        <circle cx="24" cy="16" r="9"/>
        <path d="M16 27 h16 l4 28 h-24 z"/>
        <rect x="13" y="53" width="9" height="44"/>
        <rect x="28" y="53" width="9" height="44"/>
        <rect x="38" y="2" width="4" height="60"/>
      </g>
        <polygon points="42,4 58,4 53,15 58,26 42,26" fill="#d32f2f" stroke="#14401a" stroke-width="2"/>
      </svg>
      <!-- 삽 든 사람 -->
      <svg width="58" height="94" viewBox="0 0 58 94"><g fill="#14401a">
        <circle cx="30" cy="14" r="9"/>
        <path d="M22 25 h16 l4 28 h-24 z"/>
        <rect x="20" y="51" width="9" height="40"/>
        <rect x="34" y="51" width="9" height="40"/>
        <rect x="6" y="22" width="3" height="50" transform="rotate(18 7 47)"/>
        <path d="M2 70 l10 4 -2 10 -10 -4 z" transform="rotate(18 6 78)"/>
      </g></svg>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 취급 품목 -->
  <section class="items">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">취급 품목</div>
      <div class="sec-tag">▶ 한 집에 다 있다! 생필품부터 못 한 봉지까지</div>
      <div class="item-grid">

        <div class="item-card">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="#1b5e20"><path d="M4 8h20l-2 16H6L4 8z"/><path d="M9 8V6a5 5 0 0110 0v2" fill="none" stroke="#1b5e20" stroke-width="2.5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>생활필수품</h3>
          <p>쌀·라면·간장·식용유·세제·휴지·계란. 끼니 살림 한 번에 해결.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item-card">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="#a31515"><path d="M14 2l3 9h9l-7 6 3 9-8-5-8 5 3-9-7-6h9z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>철물·공구</h3>
          <p>망치·드라이버·못·나사·경첩·문고리·줄자. 집수리 준비 끝.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item-card">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="#1b5e20"><rect x="5" y="5" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M5 11h18M11 5v18" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>전기·배관</h3>
          <p>전구·콘센트·전선·테이프·PVC관·수도꼭지·고무패킹 상비.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="item-card">
          <div class="ic">
